{
  "layout": "oz_pda_vpp_pane",
  "note": "PDA pane of the admin window: the Tuning.json form in two sub-columns on the left, and on the right two mini-tabs -- HARDWARE (the module/carrier form over the list) and PROFILES (the raw file in an editor). Created by OZ_PdaVppPane.OnCreate under M_SUB_WIDGET (the core's OZ_VppRoot) at [0, vpp.paneY], the same rectangle every other pane of this window claims, so the script shows one at a time. Thirty names are resolved by string from OZ_PdaVppPane.c (17 Tun_* through SetEdit/GetEdit, 8 Hw*, HwList, PdaHwBox, PdaProfBox, PdaProfEdit, BtnHwWritableText) and ten more are the button names OnClick dispatches on; PdaHint is read by the core's own Hint(). Every Tun_* and Hw* edit box now sits in a field frame -- the 25 bare boxes of the hand-written file are gone. The old full-width PDA TUNING head is not here: the six group heads name every field and the 30+6 units a spanning head costs are exactly the row that would push the right-hand tuning column past the pane's bottom edge (arithmetic in the task report); SAVE TUNING still carries the word. Caption and field widths are literals throughout -- 170/105 in the tuning sub-columns, 130/250 in the hardware form -- not $vpp.labelW/$vpp.fieldW: the two tokens sum to 460, and neither the 275-unit sub-column nor the 380-unit column has room for them.",
  "root": {"frame": {"name": "OZ_PdaVppPane", "size": "$vpp.pane", "at": [0, "$vpp.paneY"], "inset": "$vpp.inset",
    "hidden": true, "priority": 2,
    "note": "Hidden: the core's ShowPane shows the open tab's pane and hides the rest.",
    "children": [
      {"vbox": {"name": "PdaBody", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
        {"hbox": {"name": "PdaCols", "h": "fill", "gap": "$space.column", "children": [

          {"hbox": {"name": "PdaTun", "w": 560, "gap": "$space.gap", "children": [

            {"vbox": {"name": "PdaTunA", "w": 275, "gap": "$space.tight",
              "note": "PIN and CHAT, then SAVE TUNING at the foot of the column it belongs to -- where the hand-written pane put it.",
              "children": [
              {"section": {"name": "TunG0", "text": "PIN"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_PinMaxFails", "w": 170, "text": "max fails", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_PinMaxFails", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_PinLockoutSeconds", "w": 170, "text": "lockout, s", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_PinLockoutSeconds", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"section": {"name": "TunG1", "text": "CHAT"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatMsgMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "msg bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatMsgMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatTitleMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "title bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatTitleMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatDescMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "desc bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatDescMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatHistoryOpen", "w": 170, "text": "history open", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatHistoryOpen", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatHistoryPage", "w": 170, "text": "history page", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatHistoryPage", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ChatGroupMax", "w": 170, "text": "group max", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ChatGroupMax", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"gap": {"h": "fill"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnTunSave", "text": "SAVE TUNING", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}}
            ]}},

            {"vbox": {"name": "PdaTunB", "w": 275, "gap": "$space.tight",
              "note": "NOTES, MARKS, CONTACTS and HUD: four heads and nine rows, 444 of the 456 units this column has.",
              "children": [
              {"section": {"name": "TunG2", "text": "NOTES"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_NoteTitleMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "title bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_NoteTitleMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_NoteBodyMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "body bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_NoteBodyMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"section": {"name": "TunG3", "text": "MARKS"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_MarkerNameMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "name bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_MarkerNameMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_MarkerDescMaxBytes", "w": 170, "text": "desc bytes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_MarkerDescMaxBytes", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"section": {"name": "TunG4", "text": "CONTACTS"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_FriendReachMeters", "w": 170, "text": "reach, m", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_FriendReachMeters", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_SwapOfferTtlSeconds", "w": 170, "text": "offer ttl, s", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_SwapOfferTtlSeconds", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"section": {"name": "TunG5", "text": "HUD"}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_ToastSeconds", "w": 170, "text": "toast, s", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_ToastSeconds", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_RouteAdvanceMeters", "w": 170, "text": "route advance, m", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_RouteAdvanceMeters", "w": 105}}
              ]}},
              {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                {"label": {"name": "TunL_BeaconPushSeconds", "w": 170, "text": "beacon push, s", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                {"field": {"name": "Tun_BeaconPushSeconds", "w": 105}}
              ]}}
            ]}}

          ]}},

          {"vbox": {"name": "PdaSide", "w": 380, "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
            {"hbox": {"name": "PdaSubTabs", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.gap", "children": [
              {"button": {"name": "BtnPdaSubHw", "w": 185, "text": "HARDWARE"}},
              {"button": {"name": "BtnPdaSubProf", "w": 185, "text": "PROFILES"}}
            ]}},
            {"frame": {"name": "PdaSideBody", "h": "fill",
              "note": "The two mini-tabs share one rectangle: OnClick shows one and hides the other, so they are siblings at the same origin, not a stack.",
              "children": [

              {"frame": {"name": "PdaHwBox", "size": "fill", "children": [
                {"vbox": {"name": "HwBody", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                  {"listbox": {"name": "HwList", "h": "fill", "font": "field", "color": "$text",
                    "props": {"style": "NoScrollBar", "title visible": false, "highlight row": true, "lines": 4},
                    "note": "The engine's own listbox, filled by AddItem; 4 lines over 118 units keeps the 30-unit row of the hand-written pane."}},
                  {"vbox": {"name": "HwForm", "h": 224,
                    "note": "Eight rows of $size.field with no gap between them: one table of module and carrier attributes, and the 42 units a $space.tight gap would eat are the two list rows above it.",
                    "children": [
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwClassL", "w": 130, "text": "classname", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwClass", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwNameL", "w": 130, "text": "display name", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwName", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwKindL", "w": 130, "text": "kind", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwKind", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwRangeL", "w": 130, "text": "range, m", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwRange", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field",
                      "note": "Admin-visible data only: nothing in the drain path multiplies this into energyUsagePerSecond (config.cpp) -- the label says so because the field would otherwise promise an effect the game does not have (finding 98, task 52).",
                      "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwPowerL", "w": 130, "text": "power (inert)", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwPower", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwSpyL", "w": 130, "text": "spy minutes", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwSpy", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwPagesL", "w": 130, "text": "enables pages", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwPages", "w": 250}}
                    ]}},
                    {"hrow": {"h": "$size.field", "children": [
                      {"label": {"name": "HwMarksL", "w": 130, "text": "max records", "font": "small", "color": "$muted"}},
                      {"field": {"name": "HwMarks", "w": 250}}
                    ]}}
                  ]}},
                  {"hbox": {"name": "HwActions", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.gap", "children": [
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnHwWritable", "w": 160, "text": "writable: yes",
                      "note": "A toggle, not a command: PaintHwToggles rewrites BtnHwWritableText on every pick."}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnHwSave", "w": 100, "text": "SAVE", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnHwDel", "w": 100, "text": "DELETE", "edge": "$bad", "color": "$bad"}}
                  ]}},
                  {"hbox": {"name": "HwNew", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.gap", "children": [
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnHwNewMod", "w": 185, "text": "NEW MODULE"}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnHwNewCar", "w": 185, "text": "NEW CARRIER"}}
                  ]}}
                ]}}
              ]}},

              {"frame": {"name": "PdaProfBox", "size": "fill", "hidden": true,
                "note": "Hidden first, exactly as the hand-written file had it: HARDWARE is the mini-tab the pane opens on, and OnClick swaps the pair.",
                "children": [
                {"vbox": {"name": "ProfBody", "gap": "$space.tight", "children": [
                  {"field": {"name": "PdaProfEdit", "h": "fill", "lines": 21,
                    "note": "Profiles.json as text. 21 lines is what the 384-unit box holds at the fixed 14-point field face."}},
                  {"hbox": {"name": "ProfActions", "h": "$size.button", "gap": "$space.gap", "children": [
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnProfReload", "w": 185, "text": "RELOAD"}},
                    {"button": {"name": "BtnProfApply", "w": 185, "text": "APPLY", "edge": "$ok", "color": "$ok"}}
                  ]}}
                ]}}
              ]}}

            ]}}
          ]}}

        ]}},
        {"label": {"name": "PdaHint", "h": "$size.hint", "font": "hint", "color": "$muted",
          "note": "Empty: the core's Hint() finds this label by name and every answer of the PDA route lands here."}}
      ]}}
    ]}}
}
